WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.500 --> 01:46.860
=Episode 28=

01:47.680 --> 01:51.280
Xuwei has been waiting for you
for a long time.

01:51.960 --> 01:53.750
You want to know about your origins,
don't you?

01:54.920 --> 01:55.979
Then come with me.

02:17.120 --> 02:18.190
Xuwei.

02:19.800 --> 02:21.800
You've all been plotting and scheming
for so long.

02:21.800 --> 02:24.030
So tell us the truth now.

02:36.590 --> 02:39.280
We must start from the very beginning,
the story of Zhu Yu.

02:40.750 --> 02:42.680
(Zhu Yu bound Mist Soul by blood.)

02:43.640 --> 02:47.070
(We have been collecting a great deal of
Vitality Energy for her to feed on,)

02:47.070 --> 02:48.110
(and heal the Yu clan.)

02:49.680 --> 02:52.000
(But inside the Qiyuan Orb,)

02:52.000 --> 02:55.440
(there were still some dark emotions
left by humans on the brink of death.)

02:57.110 --> 02:58.829
(Zhu Yu devoured all of them)

03:00.080 --> 03:01.440
(and gradually became demonic.)

03:02.790 --> 03:05.000
(If somehow things got out of control,)

03:05.680 --> 03:08.400
(the Six Realms
would be doomed for sure.)

03:09.760 --> 03:12.780
(Therefore, we have reached an agreement
with Zhu Yu.)

03:13.360 --> 03:16.320
(Once the situation gets out of control,
we can kill her.)

03:17.280 --> 03:19.870
(But only the child she created)

03:20.440 --> 03:24.000
with her own flesh and blood
has the ability to kill her.

03:29.680 --> 03:34.400
Zhu Yu personally named that child "Qi".

03:49.110 --> 03:50.320
What nonsense are you talking about?

03:53.110 --> 03:57.190
This is the truth
you have long desired to know.

04:02.670 --> 04:06.310
What about Jinzhao?
What does he have to do with this?

04:07.390 --> 04:08.460
Three years ago,

04:09.950 --> 04:13.880
someone told me about the existence
of Yue Jinzhao for the first time.

04:16.470 --> 04:18.829
Xuwei, there is something
I'd like to tell you.

04:19.440 --> 04:20.600
I don't want to hear it.

04:20.600 --> 04:22.600
But I haven't even said anything yet.

04:23.160 --> 04:25.280
It's always about Qi, isn't it?

04:26.360 --> 04:30.720
Xuwei, Qi has been in the Yujie Hub
for over a decade.

04:31.360 --> 04:32.800
Long enough for her

04:33.670 --> 04:36.030
to know every single ant here.

04:39.550 --> 04:43.950
Please, just for one day,
let me take her to the Mortal Realm.

04:44.640 --> 04:45.670
Be back the next day, okay?

04:51.600 --> 04:52.750
I won't give up on this.

05:09.830 --> 05:10.890
Hold on.

05:14.440 --> 05:15.470
Get her out of here now.

05:22.470 --> 05:23.560
Xuwei.

05:27.030 --> 05:28.040
Luohuan?

05:33.080 --> 05:34.090
You're not Luohuan.

05:35.600 --> 05:37.470
You weren't wearing this when I saw you.

05:39.470 --> 05:40.520
Who are you?

05:41.830 --> 05:42.880
I am Huan.

05:57.830 --> 05:59.320
I can't believe you drugged me.

06:00.280 --> 06:04.040
Sorry, Xuwei. But I am Huan,

06:06.000 --> 06:09.160
from three years in the future,
to be precise.

06:12.830 --> 06:14.480
Then why are you here?

06:15.440 --> 06:16.950
What I'm about to tell you

06:18.000 --> 06:19.160
may sound completely unbelievable.

06:20.920 --> 06:24.760
But it's fine. Time will tell.

06:25.880 --> 06:29.070
Three years later,
due to severe injuries,

06:29.070 --> 06:30.480
I won't be able to resonate with Qi.

06:31.480 --> 06:34.760
I could not join her in the mission
to confront and defeat Zhu Yu.

06:35.720 --> 06:38.830
That's why I traveled here
from Mist Soul

06:39.440 --> 06:41.600
and made it to Dragon Pool
to exchange for a new me.

06:43.350 --> 06:44.830
I'll leave him in this time and space

06:45.880 --> 06:47.950
to resonate with Qi
in this world in my place,

06:48.630 --> 06:50.350
and restart the mission to kill Zhu Yu.

06:51.080 --> 06:52.430
I have erased Qi's memories,

06:53.040 --> 06:54.480
and will to send her
to the Mortal Realm.

06:58.550 --> 07:00.480
She would wake up in Wuyan Village,

07:03.440 --> 07:06.880
with another person.

07:08.000 --> 07:10.110
Another person? What about you?

07:11.320 --> 07:15.320
He is the one I will exchange
from the Dragon Pool.

07:21.320 --> 07:25.070
His name is Yue Jinzhao.

07:31.280 --> 07:32.550
Yue Jinzhao.

07:34.159 --> 07:37.200
His resonance with Qi
will far surpass mine.

07:39.480 --> 07:41.320
They will spend three years
exploring the Mortal Realm,

07:41.320 --> 07:43.880
until they gain the power
to kill Zhu Yu.

07:59.280 --> 08:00.360
I don't believe it.

08:01.790 --> 08:02.950
I didn't believe it at first.

08:09.110 --> 08:13.280
Xuwei told me Qi had been taken away
three years ago.

08:13.840 --> 08:15.440
There would be someone named Yue Jinzhao

08:15.440 --> 08:17.000
to replace me and stay by Qi's side.

08:19.600 --> 08:21.000
I just couldn't believe it.

08:23.630 --> 08:27.230
Not until I went to Wuyan Village
and saw him with my own eyes.

08:33.720 --> 08:36.280
Xuwei, I'm in a hurry to find Qi.

08:37.110 --> 08:38.159
Stop joking with me.

08:39.159 --> 08:41.950
Yes, Xuwei, that could be someone else.

08:51.480 --> 08:52.490
Qi.

08:55.720 --> 08:56.750
Qi.

09:30.760 --> 09:31.920
Let's take them back first.

09:34.950 --> 09:38.510
Upon examination, we discovered
that you can indeed resonate with Qi.

09:39.830 --> 09:42.600
Moreover, your resonance exceeded mine.

09:45.630 --> 09:47.110
So Xuwei decided to have you

09:48.320 --> 09:52.670
take my place and resonate with Qi
to complete the mission.

09:53.230 --> 09:55.390
We informed Zhu Yu about this.

09:56.160 --> 09:59.160
She agreed to send you two back
to the Mortal Realm to live for a while.

10:00.280 --> 10:02.790
We brought you back to Wuyan Village.

10:04.350 --> 10:06.920
Huan was responsible for
secretly protecting you

10:08.110 --> 10:09.510
and guiding you
through your experiences.

10:11.440 --> 10:15.510
As is said, three years later,
I have sustained serious injuries.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.630
That person and Xuwei's words

10:19.240 --> 10:20.720
have all been verified today.

10:21.430 --> 10:24.360
I cannot revive someone
without a trade-off.

10:25.040 --> 10:26.870
At the cost
of the existence of the wisher,

10:27.950 --> 10:31.360
I can bring back the person they want.

10:32.040 --> 10:34.750
The number of lives in the world
is fixed and cannot be changed.

10:38.120 --> 10:41.830
To resurrect a life, the wisher must
sacrifice their existence,

10:42.480 --> 10:45.480
and all memories related to themselves
as the price.

10:46.630 --> 10:49.680
Only then can I bring back
the person they want.

10:51.600 --> 10:53.280
Isn't this just trading one life
for another?

10:54.950 --> 10:57.190
And after that,

10:57.190 --> 10:59.720
it's as if the wisher never existed.

11:00.830 --> 11:03.070
The anomalies will be corrected
by the path of heaven.

11:03.800 --> 11:07.240
The traces of the wisher
will naturally be overlaid by others.

11:09.720 --> 11:10.830
So you mean

11:11.800 --> 11:15.040
what that one did will be remembered
as someone else's doing,

11:15.750 --> 11:18.480
and nothing seems to be wrong to anyone.

11:19.190 --> 11:20.200
Exactly.

11:21.040 --> 11:23.830
Miss Ming, you mustn't do it.

11:24.630 --> 11:26.310
If you exchange yourself for Mr. Gu,

11:26.310 --> 11:28.040
then there will be no Ming Xiu
in this world.

11:28.870 --> 11:33.680
Ming Xiu, even the traces
that you've ever left will be gone.

11:40.630 --> 11:42.480
I've always been suspicious of you.

11:43.360 --> 11:45.040
You deliberately schemed against
me and Qi,

11:46.750 --> 11:49.600
and even guided her to gain power
by absorbing the Qiyuan Orb.

11:51.630 --> 11:53.120
I didn't understand why.

11:54.390 --> 11:58.600
Now it all became clear.

12:01.120 --> 12:03.920
Turns out Qi and I are here to fulfill
an important mission.

12:06.870 --> 12:10.950
It was an accident that Qi
absorbed the Qiyuan Orb at Fujin Hall.

12:12.720 --> 12:14.800
The incident at the headquarters
was my doing.

12:16.560 --> 12:18.190
It has nothing to do with Luohuan.

12:26.240 --> 12:28.040
You have planned all of this

12:31.120 --> 12:35.510
just to get Jinzhao and me
to kill Zhu Yu?

12:38.990 --> 12:41.560
We would not have done it

12:41.560 --> 12:42.800
if we had had any other choice.

12:44.160 --> 12:47.040
Currently, petrification is occurring
in various places.

12:47.750 --> 12:52.190
It seems that Zhu Yu has begun
to ripen and absorb the Qiyuan Orb,

12:53.040 --> 12:55.510
which means she has
completely lost her mind.

12:59.070 --> 13:01.360
Have you seen my De'er?

13:01.360 --> 13:03.280
It must have been Luo family
scheming behind the scenes.

13:03.920 --> 13:06.990
Uncle Nian's grandson
had been doing well.

13:06.990 --> 13:09.120
How could he suddenly
turn into a stone a few days ago?

13:10.280 --> 13:13.930
Turns out all of this

13:15.990 --> 13:17.070
has been the doing of Zhu Yu.

13:18.950 --> 13:20.240
If Zhu Yu is not killed,

13:21.310 --> 13:25.240
the entire realm will be plunged into
misery and suffering.

13:46.280 --> 13:49.190
Yue, Miss Yue, those from Hengdao Sect
must be deceiving you.

13:49.870 --> 13:50.920
How could this happen?

13:51.830 --> 13:54.950
Ying Xuwei has invited us to visit
the Sea of Clear Skies tomorrow.

13:54.950 --> 13:56.560
We'll enter the Mist Soul,
and see it in person.

13:59.390 --> 14:01.280
Traveling back to three years ago
through the Mist Soul?

14:04.160 --> 14:05.990
Yes, it just occurred to me

14:07.120 --> 14:09.240
that Maiming had collected information
about the Nine Springs.

14:09.990 --> 14:11.440
It was recorded in a book

14:12.040 --> 14:14.160
that the Mist Soul can change time

14:14.160 --> 14:16.070
and allow people to go back in time
to the past.

14:22.120 --> 14:25.510
Jinzhao, Little Yue, we will
go with you tomorrow.

14:25.510 --> 14:28.390
Xian Qing is right.
Let's face this together.

14:31.440 --> 14:32.520
Thank you.

14:33.040 --> 14:34.120
Jinzhao.

14:44.680 --> 14:48.070
Miss Yue, he may need some time

14:48.070 --> 14:49.390
to process it.

14:51.630 --> 14:54.220
Little Yue, go get some rest.

14:56.270 --> 14:57.280
Miss Yue.

14:57.280 --> 15:00.630
I'm fine. I'm going to get
the Yunlai Stone from Ming Xiu.

15:20.240 --> 15:21.290
Qingfei.

15:23.560 --> 15:25.160
Drinking while you're so weak?

15:27.120 --> 15:28.200
Qingfei, have some with me.

15:31.240 --> 15:35.480
That day, you took her to
the Hundred-Foot Spring Platform,

15:36.600 --> 15:39.510
I thought you wanted her to recall
your kindness.

15:42.480 --> 15:45.360
I didn't expect her to fight with you.

15:47.750 --> 15:48.830
I couldn't hold back

15:49.680 --> 15:51.870
and told her everything you did.

15:53.720 --> 15:57.870
Huan, I'm sorry. I should have
asked you first.

16:00.390 --> 16:04.080
Never mind. It doesn't matter anymore.

16:04.720 --> 16:05.800
Why?

16:10.950 --> 16:12.040
Why what?

16:13.510 --> 16:17.920
Don't play dumb. You obviously
didn't want to reconcile with her.

16:18.830 --> 16:20.040
You wanted her to hate you.

16:22.600 --> 16:25.510
I knew you would be able to
see through it.

16:27.280 --> 16:29.430
Huan, what's the real reason?

16:33.390 --> 16:34.440
I'd prefer to have her hatred

16:35.870 --> 16:39.310
if she doesn't love me.

16:40.830 --> 16:42.040
Still, better than being forgotten.

17:20.069 --> 17:24.480
Jinzhao, don't stay by yourself.

17:25.630 --> 17:26.750
I would be worried.

17:30.600 --> 17:33.800
Qi, to be honest,

17:36.480 --> 17:37.750
I don't know how to face you.

17:38.580 --> 17:43.280
♪The pouring rain soaks up old memories♪

17:43.280 --> 17:47.210
♪Blurring my memories about you♪

17:47.210 --> 17:49.160
♪The more I try to forget,
the clearer they become♪

17:49.750 --> 17:50.830
Just face me like this.

17:51.400 --> 17:54.250
♪Why the world keeps changing♪

17:54.250 --> 17:57.580
♪Scattered by the crowds♪

17:57.580 --> 18:01.740
♪We are like being
at the two ends of the outcome♪

18:02.360 --> 18:03.950
If what the Hengdao Sect said is true,

18:06.480 --> 18:07.750
as long as our resonance exists,

18:10.600 --> 18:12.510
I am the one who manipulates you
to kill your mother.

18:13.930 --> 18:15.600
♪The longing is hard to endure♪

18:15.600 --> 18:18.350
♪Yet you are not here♪

18:19.830 --> 18:21.480
Even if I am a weapon,

18:22.800 --> 18:26.830
the one who can control me
and possess me, can only be you.

18:31.040 --> 18:33.240
Although I hate
being treated as a weapon,

18:36.940 --> 18:39.570
I prefer you to be the only swordsman.

18:43.830 --> 18:48.350
Qi, I don't want you to suffer
a fate like that.

18:51.060 --> 18:54.090
♪And dialogues get unfamiliar♪

18:54.090 --> 19:01.480
♪If time could pause for me
at the crossroads of parting♪

19:03.310 --> 19:06.540
♪Fulfill a wish♪

19:09.110 --> 19:11.510
Jinzhao, let's elope.

19:29.990 --> 19:31.840
Xuwei, bad news!

19:31.840 --> 19:34.470
Qi and Yue Jinzhao have run away.

19:42.920 --> 19:44.110
Did you let them go?

19:47.710 --> 19:51.920
Yes, I informed the guards in advance
not to stop them.

20:04.590 --> 20:07.280
Why? You are out of your mind!

20:09.750 --> 20:13.280
We've spent years
planning for this moment.

20:13.990 --> 20:15.050
How dare you!

20:22.630 --> 20:23.630
They will come back.

20:27.160 --> 20:29.870
I know they will, and I trust them.

20:32.110 --> 20:33.510
Given we got their friends in Yujie Hub,

20:34.750 --> 20:35.990
they will be back no matter what.

20:38.040 --> 20:40.960
Xuwei, we only have half a day left.

20:41.840 --> 20:42.960
I hope you're right.

20:47.440 --> 20:50.230
(Qi, Yue Jinzhao,)

20:52.440 --> 20:54.680
(this is the last thing
I can do for you.)

20:59.680 --> 21:03.350
I didn't expect the origins of Jinzhao
and Little Yue to be so extraordinary.

21:05.590 --> 21:07.240
Miss Yue came
to borrow the Yunlai Stone.

21:07.240 --> 21:09.640
She must have left here with Mr. Yue.

21:13.920 --> 21:15.820
I, for one, hope they go
as far away as possible.

21:16.390 --> 21:17.470
It shouldn't be just them

21:18.040 --> 21:19.800
to deal with this huge responsibility.

21:23.320 --> 21:24.750
Shifang, are you worried

21:25.350 --> 21:26.960
that the Hengdao Sect
will take us as hostages?

21:28.080 --> 21:29.110
Of course not.

21:29.870 --> 21:32.350
If Hengdao Sect dares to do so,
we'll fight our way out.

21:34.510 --> 21:35.920
I'm just worried that the two kids

21:36.800 --> 21:38.320
won't allow us to be held captive.

21:54.440 --> 21:56.470
Jinzhao, what's wrong?

22:00.750 --> 22:01.840
I'm thinking about my origin.

22:03.920 --> 22:08.160
Turns out, my existence is to ensure
the safety of mortals.

22:09.960 --> 22:11.630
That's why the world

22:13.230 --> 22:14.870
needs Yue Jinzhao.

22:17.110 --> 22:18.350
But isn't it

22:21.680 --> 22:22.700
too much for me?

22:24.920 --> 22:27.390
Has anyone asked for my opinion?

22:31.110 --> 22:32.870
Do you regret discovering your origins?

22:32.870 --> 22:33.960
Yes.

22:36.390 --> 22:38.110
If we had stayed in Wuyan Village,

22:39.390 --> 22:41.160
we would have lived a peaceful life,

22:42.160 --> 22:45.230
poor but stable,

22:46.350 --> 22:47.750
like every ordinary person.

22:54.990 --> 22:58.080
But then, we wouldn't have made it
to Yinghui Fort.

22:59.350 --> 23:01.080
We wouldn't have had
so many good friends,

23:01.800 --> 23:03.710
nor would we have had
so many precious experiences.

23:04.920 --> 23:06.280
Just look on the bright side.

23:18.390 --> 23:20.280
Jinzhao, Jing'an is right there.

23:21.260 --> 23:22.350
Let's go have some fun.

23:44.990 --> 23:46.510
Look, how beautiful it is.

23:59.110 --> 24:00.200
Let's go.

24:02.320 --> 24:03.370
Check this out.

24:13.040 --> 24:17.110
Jinzhao, today, let's put aside
all our worries and have fun.

24:20.990 --> 24:22.030
Okay.

25:08.140 --> 25:09.160
Impressive.

25:11.820 --> 25:12.840
Hit the mark again.

25:16.170 --> 25:17.260
Impressive.

25:20.170 --> 25:21.230
So amazing!

25:22.740 --> 25:23.760
Here you go.

25:25.990 --> 25:27.080
Is it sweet?

25:27.750 --> 25:29.110
Sweet.

25:29.110 --> 25:30.320
Here you go, kids.

25:30.320 --> 25:32.040
- Miss.
- I want one.

25:32.040 --> 25:33.080
- Me too.
- I want one too.

25:33.080 --> 25:34.280
Here you go.

25:34.280 --> 25:35.800
- I want one too.
- Miss, I want one too.

25:36.680 --> 25:37.990
- Miss.
- Miss.

25:40.110 --> 25:41.200
Let's go.

25:42.800 --> 25:44.680
It's really great to be a child.

25:44.680 --> 25:47.350
So carefree, with no worries at all.

25:47.350 --> 25:49.630
Yeah, even if the sky falls,

25:49.630 --> 25:51.080
tall guys like us would hold it up.

25:52.850 --> 25:55.820
(Prayer Pavilion)

26:04.040 --> 26:05.130
Want to write something?

26:05.130 --> 26:06.220
Let me see.

26:10.960 --> 26:12.820
(A lifetime filled with love)

26:16.780 --> 26:18.120
(Peace and prosperity for my offspring)

26:22.440 --> 26:26.280
Jinzhao, people always make wishes
to the invisible deities.

26:26.990 --> 26:28.040
Does it really work?

26:30.840 --> 26:34.750
Maybe they're not worshiping the deities
but the heaven and earth.

26:36.630 --> 26:37.680
The heaven and earth?

26:38.440 --> 26:41.750
The grace of heaven and earth
nourishes all beings.

26:42.920 --> 26:45.510
They are probably seeking blessings
from heaven and earth.

26:49.160 --> 26:52.110
But I think people should
worship themselves instead.

26:53.590 --> 26:55.080
Even if heaven and earth
grant them grace,

26:55.630 --> 26:59.080
they still have to work hard
to create and maintain good lives.

27:02.080 --> 27:05.510
Yes, you're right. We're on our own.

27:09.460 --> 27:10.960
(Prayer Pavilion)

27:11.470 --> 27:14.670
Yaofang, the moon is beautiful,
isn't it?

27:14.670 --> 27:15.750
Yes.

27:15.750 --> 27:17.470
Let's go appreciate together.

27:17.470 --> 27:18.510
Alright.

27:20.320 --> 27:21.920
Mr. and Mrs. Ji.

27:21.920 --> 27:23.470
Mr. Yue, Miss Yue.

27:26.200 --> 27:28.040
This is the girl I told you about,

27:28.040 --> 27:29.920
the one you mistook for Zhu'er.

27:31.990 --> 27:33.680
Miss, I am truly sorry.

27:34.510 --> 27:37.800
I was confused at the time
and caused you trouble.

27:37.800 --> 27:39.160
No worries.

27:39.160 --> 27:41.560
You treated me
to delicious tofu pudding, remember?

27:42.350 --> 27:43.350
Right.

27:43.350 --> 27:44.750
Mr. Ji,

27:44.750 --> 27:46.590
Mrs. Ji has recovered, hasn't she?

27:49.350 --> 27:50.750
My wife is pregnant.

27:51.510 --> 27:53.560
Ever since we had a child again,

27:54.160 --> 27:56.320
Yaofang has suddenly returned to normal.

28:02.510 --> 28:03.530
Do you want to touch it?

28:14.630 --> 28:15.870
Can I listen to it?

28:26.080 --> 28:27.750
How come I can't hear anything?

28:28.350 --> 28:31.200
The baby is still small.
Naturally, you can't hear it.

28:32.560 --> 28:36.200
However, I can sense every breath

28:36.840 --> 28:38.630
and heartbeat of it.

28:39.750 --> 28:42.800
Even in the noisiest marketplace,

28:44.160 --> 28:45.800
I wouldn't miss a single beat.

28:47.230 --> 28:52.390
I often recall when you were
growing inside me,

28:54.160 --> 28:56.350
I was amazed at how such a tiny life

28:56.920 --> 29:01.560
had a heartbeat that was louder than
any other sound in the world.

29:04.750 --> 29:07.750
My mother has said the same to me.

29:08.870 --> 29:10.350
She must have loved you very much.

29:26.920 --> 29:30.110
Jinzhao, do you know what I'm thinking?

29:32.440 --> 29:35.680
I want the child in Mrs. Ji's belly
to be born safely.

29:38.640 --> 29:39.720
Jing'an is so lively.

29:40.470 --> 29:42.960
I hope everyone can live
in peace and safety.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.680
I want to protect everything here.

29:53.710 --> 29:54.800
Qi.

29:57.960 --> 29:59.020
Let's return to the Yujie Hub.

30:03.800 --> 30:04.810
I have thought it through.

30:06.390 --> 30:07.470
Even if I start over,

30:09.160 --> 30:13.160
I'd still leave Wuyan Village
and embark on this journey with you.

30:16.320 --> 30:17.360
Jinzhao.

30:22.080 --> 30:25.440
I was an orphan born in Nine Springs.

30:27.750 --> 30:30.990
But I grew up in this world, I think

30:33.920 --> 30:35.630
I should try my best to do something
for its sake.

30:40.750 --> 30:42.800
I'll try my best to find a solution
that satisfies both sides

30:44.960 --> 30:46.470
to protect Zhu Yu and the Mortal Realm.

30:49.590 --> 30:50.670
I know.

30:53.160 --> 30:54.190
I have faith in you.

31:01.200 --> 31:02.220
The jade pendant.

31:02.920 --> 31:03.950
Let me put it on you.

31:08.110 --> 31:09.870
There, now the pendants
are a matching pair.

31:13.870 --> 31:14.960
Qi,

31:16.870 --> 31:20.230
from now on, no matter what happens,

31:22.470 --> 31:26.040
I will always be by your side
and we will face it together.

31:29.580 --> 31:31.080
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

31:31.080 --> 31:33.070
♪I engrave your name♪

31:33.070 --> 31:39.600
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

31:59.920 --> 32:04.270
(Pray for peace of the world.
Qi, Jinzhao)

32:27.870 --> 32:28.970
Fancy a drink?

32:31.040 --> 32:32.040
A pre-death drink?

32:33.750 --> 32:34.800
Huan.

32:38.710 --> 32:41.750
Xuwei is waiting for you
on the rooftop. Go meet him.

33:34.230 --> 33:38.110
Your organs will deteriorate faster
if you drink like this.

33:39.200 --> 33:40.960
Even if no one will treat you
in the future,

33:41.630 --> 33:43.080
you do not have to destroy yourself.

33:46.280 --> 33:47.280
Sit.

34:10.159 --> 34:11.239
Sorry,

34:14.110 --> 34:15.679
for being an incompetent brother.

34:17.870 --> 34:18.920
Well, that's true.

34:19.800 --> 34:22.280
You've been acting smug since childhood.

34:23.350 --> 34:24.750
Every time Qingfei and I made mistakes,

34:25.440 --> 34:27.590
you would severely scold us.

34:31.469 --> 34:32.800
A terrible brother indeed.

34:40.590 --> 34:45.199
If I had known the truth
three years ago,

34:46.389 --> 34:47.469
and chosen to run away,

34:49.350 --> 34:50.440
what would you do?

35:03.510 --> 35:04.520
You wouldn't.

35:11.110 --> 35:12.110
Actually, I really wish I had.

35:16.960 --> 35:19.040
But there are things
that I must do myself.

35:21.560 --> 35:22.640
Moreover,

35:24.470 --> 35:26.630
given the blood of so many innocents
on our hands,

35:28.710 --> 35:30.110
we are lucky to have this opportunity

35:31.630 --> 35:32.680
for atonement, aren't we?

35:54.510 --> 35:55.600
Want to atone?

35:59.080 --> 36:00.080
Maybe in the next life.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.420
It is an honor for me

36:23.150 --> 36:24.670
to have you as my eldest brother

36:27.080 --> 36:28.140
in this lifetime.

36:38.950 --> 36:40.040
Drink.

36:54.880 --> 36:58.470
However, I feel so sorry for

37:00.840 --> 37:02.190
Qi and Jinzhao,

37:05.840 --> 37:08.910
who have to bear the consequences
of our incompetence.

37:24.120 --> 37:26.120
Luohuan, why are you drinking?

37:28.190 --> 37:29.640
You're injured. No more drinks.

37:30.320 --> 37:33.800
Xiaoyuan, Luohuan is about
to embark on a long journey.

37:34.640 --> 37:37.120
It's fine to have a little drink
before that.

37:39.120 --> 37:41.880
I was wondering why I was allowed
to stay up late today.

37:44.230 --> 37:46.430
Remember to practice your skills
diligently in the future.

37:47.080 --> 37:49.560
If you piss these two off again,

37:49.560 --> 37:50.880
no one will stand up for you.

37:51.600 --> 37:53.470
Luohuan, where are you going?

37:53.470 --> 37:55.430
Somewhere fun? For how long?

37:56.190 --> 37:58.280
Don't change the subject.
Promise me first.

38:11.500 --> 38:12.510
Promise me.

38:12.510 --> 38:14.750
Alright, you have my word.

38:14.750 --> 38:17.120
I will practice hard and behave myself
from now on.

38:19.710 --> 38:20.840
Luohuan, come with me.

38:20.840 --> 38:21.840
Let's go.

39:19.470 --> 39:22.390
♪Looking back♪

39:23.510 --> 39:26.700
♪I try to bring back memories♪

39:27.600 --> 39:31.500
♪We're connected♪

39:31.500 --> 39:33.780
♪It's meant to be♪

39:35.380 --> 39:39.020
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

39:39.540 --> 39:43.350
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

39:43.350 --> 39:45.580
♪On a moonlight night♪

39:45.580 --> 39:47.570
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

39:47.570 --> 39:50.290
♪About you♪

39:50.290 --> 39:53.580
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

39:54.290 --> 39:57.680
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

39:58.230 --> 40:00.080
♪The past glided before my mind♪

40:00.080 --> 40:02.320
♪I smiled and cried♪

40:02.320 --> 40:07.570
♪For happiness♪

40:07.570 --> 40:11.470
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

40:11.470 --> 40:15.570
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

40:15.570 --> 40:17.520
♪In this tranquil world♪

40:17.520 --> 40:19.570
♪I've finally found you♪

40:19.570 --> 40:23.600
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

40:23.600 --> 40:27.340
♪I've been looking for you♪

40:27.340 --> 40:31.470
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

40:32.310 --> 40:33.740
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

40:33.740 --> 40:36.020
♪I engrave your name♪

40:36.020 --> 40:42.030
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

40:57.560 --> 41:00.560
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

41:01.520 --> 41:04.690
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

41:05.520 --> 41:09.460
♪Both of us get closer♪

41:09.460 --> 41:11.600
♪And watch the stars♪

41:13.360 --> 41:16.530
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

